{"4641640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Only Humans On Board", "steam_appid": 4641640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules are simple: <strong>Do the job.</strong> Keep the passengers satisfied, meet your daily sales quota, and whatever you do, <strong>DO NOT</strong> serve the non-humans.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stock Up at the Supermarket</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shift doesn't start until the trolley is full. Head to the local supermarket to <strong>buy your supplies</strong> before the train pulls out of the station. Navigate the aisles, grab what you need, and get to the checkout.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641640/extras/df49e703fc511693976cd430f34b6ff0.poster.avif?t=1788180627\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641640/extras/df49e703fc511693976cd430f34b6ff0.webm?t=1788180627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641640/extras/df49e703fc511693976cd430f34b6ff0.mp4?t=1788180627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Prepare Your Trolley</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your trolley is your lifeline. Before the carriage doors unlock, you must <strong>restock and organise</strong> your supplies. Move items from your supply boxes onto the trolley layout to ensure everything is in place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641640/extras/a21ad49dfc0a7418abe7d4a572f30f93.poster.avif?t=1788180627\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641640/extras/a21ad49dfc0a7418abe7d4a572f30f93.webm?t=1788180627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641640/extras/a21ad49dfc0a7418abe7d4a572f30f93.mp4?t=1788180627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Serve the Passengers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the wagon door opens, the shift begins. Move through the tight central aisles to <strong>see what the customers need</strong>. Serve them quickly and <strong>get paid</strong> by scanning their boarding passes. You’ll need every cent—use the money to <strong>upgrade your trolley</strong> for better shifts and buy the supplies you need to keep going.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641640/extras/b97b13762fe030296793464e7099df3a.poster.avif?t=1788180627\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641640/extras/b97b13762fe030296793464e7099df3a.webm?t=1788180627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641640/extras/b97b13762fe030296793464e7099df3a.mp4?t=1788180627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Check Identification</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the nights progress, you must <strong>check IDs</strong>. Use your trolley’s scanner to verify passenger details and look for any <strong>mismatches or suspicious signs</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641640/extras/45251bef13936ec77866b5014e2b32ea.poster.avif?t=1788180627\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati